  "slug": "bobs-teriyaki-sauce-and-marinade",
  "name": "Bob's Teriyaki Sauce and Marinade",
  "recipe_type": "side",
  "brief_description": "This quick and easy sauce is made with Japanese rice wine and soy sauce; it works well as a marinade, a cooking sauce, or a dipping sauce.",
  "cuisine": "Japanese",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Bring the soy sauce, mirin, sake, sugar, and ginger puree to a boil in a saucepan. Reduce heat to medium low. For a marinade, remove from heat and allow to cool. For a thicker sauce, mix cornstarch and water to form a smooth paste and stir into the mixture; allow to simmer until thickened, about 2 minutes."
    }
  ],
